{"text": "ST. BRENDAN'S REGIONAL MEDICAL CENTER                       DISCHARGE SUMMARY\n1775 Thompson Road, Coos Bay, Oregon 97420\n\nPATIENT:   ABERNATHY-NAKAMURA, HAROLD T.       MRN: 00-447-1182\nDOB:       02/11/1933  (93 y/o M)             ACCT: V0093317745\nADMITTED:  10/02/2026                        DISCHARGED: 10/07/2026\nATTENDING: Folasade Adeyinka, MD (NPI 1669704218)\nPCP:       Dr. Leonard Brzezinski\nCOVERAGE:  Medicare 4RK8-TN2-MH61; Cornerstone Senior Health Plan, member CSH 88104471 02\n\nPRINCIPAL DIAGNOSIS: Acute on chronic systolic heart failure, NYHA class III\nSECONDARY: permanent atrial fibrillation; CKD stage 3b; type 2 diabetes; mild cognitive impairment\nALLERGIES: sulfa (rash)\nCODE STATUS: DNR/DNI, confirmed with patient and daughter 10/03\n\nHOSPITAL COURSE\nMr. Abernathy-Nakamura is a retired tugboat captain who lives with his daughter. He came to the\nED with three days of worsening shortness of breath and a 9 lb weight gain after running\nout of his diuretic. BNP 1,840, creatinine 1.9 (baseline 1.6). Echo on 10/03/2026 showed\nEF 30%, unchanged. He was diuresed with IV furosemide, net negative 5.2 L, and\nreturned to room air by day 4. Device interrogation of his dual-chamber pacemaker\n(serial PJN448213H) by Dr. Villalobos showed normal function, battery 4.1 years.\nOne episode of evening confusion on night 2 resolved without medication.\n\nDISCHARGE MEDICATIONS\n  furosemide 40 mg daily (was 20 mg)        metoprolol succinate 50 mg daily\n  apixaban 2.5 mg BID                   insulin glargine 12 units nightly\n  STOP: ibuprofen. No NSAIDs.\n\nDISPOSITION: Home with Harborlight Home Health, Inc. (RN visits 3x/week, daily weights).\nDiet 2 g sodium, fluids 1.5 L. Daughter and health care agent: Karen Nakamura-Ellis,\n541-555-0137, same address: 63310 Shinglehouse Slough Road, Coos Bay 97420-8811.\nKaren manages his pill box; harold \"forgets the evening ones\" per her.\n\nFOLLOW-UP\n  Cardiology: Ignacio Villalobos, MD, Coos Bay Heart & Vascular Associates, Oct. 15, 2026 9:40 am\n  PCP: Dr. Brzezinski within 7 days; BMP at that visit.\n\nDictated: F. Adeyinka MD  10/07/2026 14:12      Transcription job #7781205", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "296 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Harold T. Abernathy-Nakamura", "Folasade Adeyinka", "Leonard Brzezinski", "Ignacio Villalobos", "Karen Nakamura-Ellis"], "companies": ["ST. BRENDAN'S REGIONAL MEDICAL CENTER", "Cornerstone Senior Health Plan", "Harborlight Home Health, Inc.", "Coos Bay Heart & Vascular Associates"]}, "chunks": 1, "chunkErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.19999999925494194, "modelMs": 17556.900000002235, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names"], "detections": [{"start": 0, "end": 37, "text": "ST. BRENDAN'S REGIONAL MEDICAL CENTER", "kind": "company", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "ST. BRENDAN'S REGIONAL MEDICAL CENTER"}, {"start": 78, "end": 96, "text": "1775 Thompson Road", "kind": "street", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "1775 Thompson Road"}, {"start": 98, "end": 106, "text": "Coos Bay", "kind": "company", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Coos Bay Heart & Vascular Associates"}, {"start": 115, "end": 120, "text": "97420", "kind": "zip", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "97420"}, {"start": 133, "end": 162, "text": "ABERNATHY-NAKAMURA, HAROLD T.", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Harold T. Abernathy-Nakamura"}, {"start": 174, "end": 185, "text": "00-447-1182", "kind": "record", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "00-447-1182"}, {"start": 197, "end": 207, "text": "02/11/1933", "kind": "dob", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "02/11/1933"}, {"start": 238, "end": 249, "text": "V0093317745", "kind": "record", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "V0093317745"}, {"start": 261